  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lasting Laos &#xbf; Supporting Young Entrepreneurs and Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises in the Lao Tourism Value Chain to Adopt and Promote Sustainable Consumption and Production, Circular Economy and Decent Work Practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Lasting Laos &#xbf; Supporting Young Entrepreneurs and Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises in the Lao Tourism Value Chain to Adopt and Promote Sustainable Consumption and Production, Circular Economy and Decent Work Practices - The objective of the SWITCH-Asia Programme is to support the transition to a low-carbon, resource-efficient and more circular economy in the Middle-East, Asia and the Pacific contributing to economic growth and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
